                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tourons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7f72d98-8da4-3839-ab66-9638d8ed9802",
                        "entry_id": "f889d21c-a20a-3bc4-98f3-49846fb8dbb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Confiserie de Noël aux amandes d’origine ibérique, équivalent au nougat.→ voir turrón"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Confiserie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbc8526e-e49c-4451-9904-863174f89224",
                                "sense_id": "e7f72d98-8da4-3839-ab66-9638d8ed9802",
                                "text": "Il aurait aimé se lever, détacher son revolver et son ceinturon, franchir les quatre cents mètres qui le séparaient des lignes ennemies, s’asseoir avec eux, partager peut-être un peu de touron et leur demander qu’on lui apprenne ces villancicos qu’il n’avait jamais pu retenir."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c75c655a-00d8-4c13-b7e5-d14d81a23ceb",
                        "source_entry_id": "f889d21c-a20a-3bc4-98f3-49846fb8dbb6",
                        "source_sense_id": "e7f72d98-8da4-3839-ab66-9638d8ed9802",
                        "target_lang_word": "touron",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "touron",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c59269a2-55f5-37b5-8cbe-b6629168edf2",
                                        "entry_id": "4a3032ce-07d1-375f-ab37-9a6ad20b8eb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tourist who acts in an ignorant or idiotic manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e371f04f-890e-4a0e-9c8a-a023f7dba06f",
                                                "sense_id": "c59269a2-55f5-37b5-8cbe-b6629168edf2",
                                                "text": "I peeled off my trencher and looped it through the shoulderstrap of my greatpurse. The youngest pickers eyed me wantonly. But they soon spotted me as a native and went back to hustling the tourons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd7565d6-8344-4df6-bcf4-ecd6e1856d00",
                                                "sense_id": "c59269a2-55f5-37b5-8cbe-b6629168edf2",
                                                "text": "I'd followed a station wagon jam-packed with tourons from New Hampshire all the way out Highway 130, and it pleased me when they slowed to a sedate twenty miles per hour as soon as they passed the town's boundary line, which meant they'd seen the Harry Starbranch unmanned traffic-control device and responded accordingly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6817c90-94df-490a-9c53-4b382784a3b4",
                                                "sense_id": "c59269a2-55f5-37b5-8cbe-b6629168edf2",
                                                "text": "In the morning the police sharpsters hacked their way through my screen door with machetes, two hysterical tourons in tow. I was just going to point out where they could find the perpetrator of the previous night's driving atrocities, out playing in the sand on the beach, when the touron woman screamed That's the monster! The touron couple were shouting and pointing at me, ace bandages and bloody gauze around their necks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4a897f6-3678-49a8-b3d1-596bfacbdb8a",
                                                "sense_id": "c59269a2-55f5-37b5-8cbe-b6629168edf2",
                                                "text": "\"I gotta slow down a little,\" Tyra said. \"Business hasn't been great. You know so many folks are losing their jobs and things won't pick up till the winter tourons get here.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "touron",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4735cfd-ef23-3c46-a86b-2404a52dc80e",
                                        "entry_id": "0ea4d181-ceb5-3112-9547-242d78a0140d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of turron."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2759450-bf74-423e-ae80-995498654b51",
                                                "sense_id": "b4735cfd-ef23-3c46-a86b-2404a52dc80e",
                                                "text": "The touron with the softest texture is Perpignan, where the maximum temperature is 251 °F (122 °C)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "092269d4-64e2-46a3-bed9-3f9fda8af917",
                        "source_entry_id": "f889d21c-a20a-3bc4-98f3-49846fb8dbb6",
                        "source_sense_id": "e7f72d98-8da4-3839-ab66-9638d8ed9802",
                        "target_lang_word": "turron",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "turron",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65ed09b3-ed23-39aa-afcd-755bedd75b24",
                                        "entry_id": "f8b8ac6a-dbb2-31ad-95e7-fc1e2ccc6733",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Spanish form of nougat made from almonds and honey."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61580c4d-3027-43db-87f8-1126478aa2ce",
                                                "sense_id": "65ed09b3-ed23-39aa-afcd-755bedd75b24",
                                                "text": "These loaves or blocks of turron are frequently a foot long and have the dimensions of American packaged bread. They come in many flavors, and may be pink, white, yellow, chocolate, green, or a stomach-churning blend of all five colors. […] The ubiquitous turrones in shop windows, frequently sliced to show the prospective consumer the texture and color pattern, range from what most generously could be described as uninspired to confections of a caliber hard to resist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
